  <item>
    <title>E53 V2.0 权益仓位配多少？重磅更新</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e038b6e2c8be315554980f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e038b6e2c8be315554980f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 01:26:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026年的第一季度实在是太忙了。经过如此动荡的三月，大家可能还惊魂未定。毛叔带来了最新的思考，大家也可以同步迭代一下自己的权益仓位啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：毛叔（资产配合布道人）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> &nbsp;蹦极般的三月，资产配置的核心依旧是控制风险，稳健长久地增值</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_9Zp_BNW-Q7002fDnQ1LX7Xb5A.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;回顾1.0版的权益仓位配置模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;2.0版本的升级的原因：更现实的面对“年龄”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>&nbsp;2.0版本的起点：可投资金的期限</span></strong><span>（友情提示：资配更适合500W以上的客户哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjYrn6cZDN5KXQtSNYoeGL0oxRgi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>2.0版本的第二步：家庭财务状况</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>2.0版本的第三步：主观风险承受能力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>2.0版本的最后：充分考虑年龄</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> &nbsp;2.0版比1.0版定出来的结果就是“千差万别”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>如何计算自己合适的权益仓位？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlLGJjx7nuB_scQYIgM4lQplU66A.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> &nbsp;拿我举个不太成功的例子？（我们真的很了解自己吗？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>没有一定比例的权益敞口就很难获得更高的长期收益</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> &nbsp;2.0版本的框架实操性更高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>&nbsp;每逢大波动，重新检视自己的仓位是必要的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> &nbsp;战术调整 VS 再平衡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5gZ1EcMQ_KBiuQ_MNy7Ov1ph0Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> &nbsp;调整需要考虑流动性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmItxpa6ZPz0iXAAmElrMevi1yfB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> &nbsp;题外话：私募的客户是什么画像？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a></span><strong><span> 私募的三种不同的分类和组合</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTS0rmQG_vbMHxvgxH1tMwf9i7K.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYHl5iixKSNuT2jkg422RkFE91A.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> &nbsp;权益配置的市场分类</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZNm847E9M_2-QIfuCTK0fmYZkN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> &nbsp;预告：</span><strong><span>A股 / 港股 / 美股 的不同与相同</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;综述 2.0 版本</span></p><span></span><p><span>附录：PPT全文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6oFjH8AHM89eojHtmsMvlA" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6oFjH8AHM89eojHtmsMvlA">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/lgL4G55t-KkfjD_ybyJ8vTP2e1va.m4a" length="61202548" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3JhCptqhxDy3pDyFnY-SH8TJl7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E52 全力拥抱AI，动态再平衡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b215fe84bce022f9009486</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b215fe84bce022f9009486</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Mar 2026 01:41:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>写在前面友情提示：本期所有内容均不构成任何投资建议，不构成实际的要约。仅仅做为投资硬核内容分享给听众朋友们。希望大家在科技投资赛道上有所启发。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>世界正在割裂。一边是中东冲突再起，全球大动脉封锁引发了石油价格的剧烈波动；一边是全网养虾热潮，AI似乎正在成为真正意义上的新质生产力。我们身处这样的世界，又该如何面对？抓住多少机遇？拥抱多少变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝愿世界和平，祝愿AI最终成为帮助人类的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容节选自《泰聚基金新春策略会》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主讲嘉宾：泰聚基金投资总监 张宪强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 《全力拥抱AI大时代，动态平衡》 的背后逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> &nbsp;科技产业新变化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>17</span></strong><strong><span>:30 &nbsp;AI将主导投资增量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>22</span></strong><strong><span>:00 算力</span></strong><strong><span>六大领域：芯 光 板 冷 电 存</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> &nbsp;机会一：液冷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 机会二：晟腾产业链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 机会三：两存产业链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 机会四：涨价资源与化工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 机会五：商业航天运力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> &nbsp;投资的一些分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>附录1 &nbsp;分化的原因</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4G8Ctn4i8HW9Zkf7Vwru90QrZ1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>附录2 AI产业的新变化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiI9H37yJQyfPyPDe_WLjy8LYO8q.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>附录3 &nbsp;时代剧变的背后：AI消费向上</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmgbx-BWDEucHKcnBEhDBO4nHtlR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>附录4：六大领域：芯 光 板 冷 电 存</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvgqL-LEFGsFh69W4VLJ3H5uKLP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>附录5 《新春策略会会议纪要》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eqRW6Cyfz-Bk-nzBQrFY9A" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eqRW6Cyfz-Bk-nzBQrFY9A">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/lo77GQyQQ9KOMzOP3b-43_bQWkvD.m4a" length="55759814" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3JhCptqhxDy3pDyFnY-SH8TJl7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E51 上头！冲顶！到底谁在控制我的情绪？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69aa2d605b2d0ed069840b0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69aa2d605b2d0ed069840b0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Mar 2026 01:30:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期献礼女神节，让我们更加健康地长久地活着！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题：到底什么在控制我们的情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：毛叔</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提示：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> &nbsp;四种最影响当下情绪的激素 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 压力激素-皮质醇（情绪总开关）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 稳定激素-血清素 （皮质醇的死对头）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 奖励激素-多巴胺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> &nbsp;应急激素-肾上腺素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> &nbsp;市场大跌的难受是来自肾上腺素+皮质醇的双重作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> &nbsp;市场大涨的开心是来多巴胺暴冲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> &nbsp;被领导骂了？和家人吵架了？还是肾上腺素+皮质醇的双重作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 男女有别，激素是不是也不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> &nbsp;脉冲式激素如何能被长期平滑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 特别提示：不要超负荷运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 人生最大的复利：不仅仅是钱，也是健康</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家多一点血清素，少一点肾上腺素！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/lt1ouaqforH5OjD97YEmkK2uJoJi.m4a" length="39914723" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3JhCptqhxDy3pDyFnY-SH8TJl7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E50 为什么私募尽调之后，大家都选了它？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69946b8866e2c30377ac5a70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69946b8866e2c30377ac5a70</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>给大家拜年啦！祝大家马年马到成功，一马当先！</span></p><span></span><p><span>做为新年拜年礼，给大家上新一期行业内的“真心话大冒险”，我们尝试去理理为什么行业规则之下选出来的总是那些人？我们尝试超脱数据背后，看看为什么必须看这些尽调的问题，又为什么在尽调之后大家都几乎选出了同样一批人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> </span><strong><span>私募尽调四要素：规模/ 背景/ 业绩/ 风格</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 规模不到5个亿的言外之意？多少规模以上是比较稳妥的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 规模超过50个亿主打安全牌？也许你得细细看看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> “英雄”也看出身，你的心目中也有鄙视链？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> &nbsp;为什么产品上架的时候都是中短期业绩高光的时刻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>市场关心的永远是能答90分的答卷</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 投资业绩一定要和投资风格挂钩？当然！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 能打底的产品长什么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 投资风格也有偏好？价值更容易？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> 怎么理解产品标签？为什么都需要一个标签？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 尽调之后，大家对什么产品是更有信心的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生也是一场投资，适合最重要。祝大家投资顺利！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/ll4Y7oYZUSP7ccVQEaFY_gRA5R_a.m4a" length="54781640" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3JhCptqhxDy3pDyFnY-SH8TJl7.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E 49 穿过枪林弹雨，活着</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6985b5d166e2c303771f0750</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6985b5d166e2c303771f0750</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
