  <item>
    <title>E41 一周跌去一年涨幅？好像见过哦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fb142f083a71a4eb09963d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fb142f083a71a4eb09963d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Oct 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题：最近一周跌去了一年的涨幅？好像还不是我一个人！慌吗？这次我反正加仓了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（由于单口，录制匆忙有些口误，还望包涵，继续努力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> &nbsp;一周跌去一年的收益？这次我果断加仓了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> &nbsp;大跌？定义一下什么级别的跌能成为大跌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;全球几个重要指数最近50年的走势看，A/H股好像都得择时？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><em><span>如果我知道终究这是一条不断创新高的曲线，每一次大跌不都创造出了一个更好的价格，让我获得更好的回报？</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> &nbsp;回溯一下我个人经历的那些牛熊拐点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 2015年无知者无畏，有超过50%的人赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 2018年相当痛苦，大家一起亏钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 2022年更加痛苦，果断换仓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 2024年极致痛苦，一周跌掉一年涨幅/跌幅怎么办呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 对“大跌”的“免疫”能力如何建立？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 面对大跌，理解它--接受它--最好能利用它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> &nbsp;超乎意料的大跌更需要严格的检视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 下跌就是一个压力测试，坚信“危”中自有“机”</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家在压力测试中以各种方法活下来，终究能活得更好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：2006--2025年各大指数的月线图（可以看图走势猜指数）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkI8OX5QenZ1WjR0EBf1fLpDsnHh.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujDyXU4YMogBZDRVhZh8L0BeRJz.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsKz5iLl6jc9wuILdV0js4Y16R71.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5QxVnVItNn5dVW2vlI3fkI1SvJ.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/lsbr5Ci0jybfO-51fVEZUkx3OfIY.m4a" length="69413878" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:51</itunes:duration>
