  <item>
    <title>E40 小登股or老登股？这不是选择题！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ddee748bf86095c58b49b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ddee748bf86095c58b49b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题：小登股近期强势霸榜，老登们看不下去啦？拜托，选择还有很多！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：红岸（半年之后再回归！理性看待市场，创造性解决问题！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 半年不见，红岸变成职业选手之后的感想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> </span><strong><span>股票新分类法：老登股/中登股/小登股</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 没办法下手小登股，也可以创造性去找一些受益的中登们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> &nbsp;单边上涨的小登股到底合理不合理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 做为老登股的代表之一，为什么银行还能买？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 老登和小登的分化背后，其实是可以</span><strong><span>创造性地做兼容的选项</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 做为投资人，均衡选手为什么也是可选项之一？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 未来市场最关注的变量是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 乐观一点的话，有没有可能A股长牛20年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 不性感的老登股最重要的可能就是坚持，做好十年不涨的准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 胜率更高的老登股和赔率更高的小登股，本就不是非黑即白的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 期待一个更全面更健康的盛世中华</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝祖国强大昌盛！大家好才是真的好！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/676a37ebf26c29a438452f6f/lqfqUGFhU7if5TTXQ_uW0jUkJgXM.m4a" length="72354984" type="audio/mp4"/>
